WEBVTT

00:07:29.954 --> 00:07:32.288
to get the person
to the services they need.

00:07:32.788 --> 00:07:35.996
Denver launched
our co-responsemodel in 2016.

00:07:36.579 --> 00:07:39.538
We launched STAR, baby CAHOOTS, in June.

00:07:40.038 --> 00:07:43.996
Today, we have 22 co-responders,
mental health professionals

00:07:44.038 --> 00:07:46.454
who ride along
with law-enforcement officers.

00:07:46.496 --> 00:07:48.496
We have 11 caseworkers.

00:07:48.538 --> 00:07:50.871
In addition, we dispatch the STAR team,

00:07:50.913 --> 00:07:53.371
a paramedic and a mental
health professional

00:07:53.413 --> 00:07:55.079
in a mobile crisis unit,

00:07:55.121 --> 00:07:58.371
who are trained to deal with someone
in a mental health emergency.

00:07:58.413 --> 00:08:01.788
They stabilize them,
they de-escalate the situation,